  666|  4.78k|
  667|  4.78k|    // Given a motion vector at 0 at higher subsampling:
  668|  4.78k|    // |  -1   |   0   |   1   |
  669|  4.78k|    // then the vectors at -1 to 2 should be tested at the current subsampling.
  670|  4.78k|    //      |-------------|
  671|  4.78k|    // | -2 -1 |  0  1 |  2  3 |
